description:
Translates text (a sentence, a message or a whole document's text, up to 10,000 characters) into another language. About 100 languages, names and numbers kept. Detects the source language when you don't give it.
Use when: you need to translate a text or document into English, French, Dutch, German, Spanish, Chinese… Paste the document's text in "text".
Example: {"text":"Hello, how are you?","target_lang":"fr"}
